<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Barom</para>
  <para style="toc1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAROMA</para>
  <para style="h">MARUBA EMWA ABAROMA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AMARUBA EMWA ABAROMA</para>
  <para style="imt2">Enshokolezi oku Maruba ga Paolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Paolo ali Muyahudi w’omu bûko bw’omulala gwa Benyamini, ci erhi anali Muroma. Aburhiragwa e Tarsi omu Silisiya, nk’omu mwâka gwa 10. Alereragwa e Yeruzalemu omu Bafarizeyi. Hôfi h’omwâka gwa 36, erhi ali omu njira mpu agend’igwârha abakristu b’e Damasi, abonekerwa na Nyakasane Yezu, na kurhenga olwo lusiku, ahinduka ntumwa yâge, amukolera n’omurhima gwâge gwoshi n’emisî yâge yoshi; ayigîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe ya Nnâmahanga hoshi hoshi, kurhenga e Yeruzalemu kuhika e Roma, ciru nkaba n’e Hispaniya. E Roma yo ahânyire ecimanyîso cizinda c’obuzigire bwâge kuli Kristu, àmufîra omu mwâka gwa 67. Paolo àrhusigîre Maruba 13:</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="io1">1. Amaruba ayandikiraga abemêzi b’e Roma (Rom), erhi ali e Korinti omu mwâka gwa 57 erhi gwa 58.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Amaruba marhanzi ayandikiraga abemêzi b’e Korinti (1 Kor), erhi ali e Efezi, omu mwâka gwa 57.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Amaruba ga kabiri arhumiraga abemêzi b’e Korinti (2 Kor); agayandikiraga e Macedoniya, omu mwâka gwa 57.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Amaruba ayandikiraga abakristu b’e Galasiya (Gal), hôfi h’omwâka gwa 57; ali e Efezi erhi e Macedoniya.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Amaruba ayandikiraga abakristu b’e Efezi (Ef), erhi ali omu mpamikwa e Roma, omu mwâka gwa 63.</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Amaruba arhumiraga abemêzi b’e Filipi (Fl), nkaba omu mwâka gwa 63, erhi ali mubohe e Roma.</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Amaruba arhumiraga abakristu b’e Kolosi (Kol), erhi ali mushwêke e Roma, omu mwâka gwa 62.</para>
  <para style="io1">8. Amaruba marhanzi ayandikiraga abakristu b’e Tesalonika (1 Tes), nkaba erhi ali e Korinti, omu mwâka gwa 50 erhi gwa 51.</para>
  <para style="io1">9. Amaruba ga kabiri ayandikiraga abakristu b’e Tesalonika (2 Tes); nago agayandikiraga e Korinti omu mwâka gwa 50 erhi gwa 51.</para>
  <para style="io1">10. Amaruba marhanzi arhumiraga Timoteyo (1 Tim), erhi ali e Macedoniya, hôfi h’omwâka gwa 65.</para>
  <para style="io1">11. Amaruba ga kabiri arhumiraga Timoteyo (2 Tim), embere afîre Kristu e Roma, omu mwâka gwa 67. Ago maruba ko kanwa kazinda k’entumwa Paolo.</para>
  <para style="io1">12. Amaruba arhumiraga Tito (Tit), erhi ali e Macedoniya, hôfi h’omwâka gwa 65.</para>
  <para style="io1">13. Amaruba ayandikiraga mwemêzi muguma w’e Kolosi, izîno lyâge ye Filemoni (Flm), erhi ali omu mpamikwa e Roma, omu mwâka gwa 62.</para>
  <para style="ib"/>
  <para style="ip">Ntà mbaka zirhume rhwatwîka Kristu nshusho ya Nnâmahanga, nîrhu rhubè nshusho ya Kristu. Oku akalamo ka Kristu eri ndolero y’entumwa, ngasi mwemêzi ali ndolero oku bandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 3:17-18">2 Kor 3, 17-18</ref></char>). Ngasi mbaka zibè za kuyêrekana erhi obwîra bwîrhu busêzire kuli Kristu ozarhuhiraga omu bwîra bwa Nnâmahanga mpu nîrhu rhulêrhe abandi omu bwîra bwa Nnâmahanga. Ntâye walutwaga duba, ci rhulinde amango Nnâmahanga aha ngasi muguma irenge likwânîne hano afulûla ebifulike omu ngasi murhima.</para>
  <para style="ip">Endagâno za Nnâmahanga zoshi muli Kristu zibà «Amen», «Nêci ntyo». Owayêmîre arhacishubiraga nyuma, bulya Kristu arhalimwo nêci na nanga; ci abà nêci oku mihigo ya Nnâmahanga. Kristu wacîjiraga mukenyi mpu rhubone obuhirhi ali lwîganyo lwîrhu okurhabâla abandi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8-9">2 Kor 8—9</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Paolo, mwambali wa Yezu Kristu, wahamagalagwa mpu abè ntumwa, aberûlwa mpu amanyîse Emyanzi y’Akalembe ka Nnâmahanga, <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>eyo Myanzi y’Akalembe Nyamuzinda alaganyagya kurhenga mîra omu kanwa k’abalêbi bâge omu Mandiko matagatîfu, <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>eyêrekîre Mugala wâge w’omu bûko bw’omu­lala gwa Daudi oku maburhwa g’omubiri; <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>erhi afûka omu bafîre ayêrekana oku anali Mugala wa Nyamuzinda ogwêrhe obuhashe bunene bwa kuli Mûka Mutagatîfu, ye Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>ye warhushobôzagya enshôkano anarhujira ntumwa, mpu rhuyigîrize abantu b’amashanja goshi okumuyêmêra n’okumuyumva, lyo izîno lyâge lijà irenge; <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>ninyu muli ba muli bo, mwe muhamagîrwe na Yezu Kristu, <verse eid="ROM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>mwe barhonyi ba Nnâmahanga muli e Roma, mwe muhamagîrwe mpu mubè batagatîfu, kuli mwe engalo n’omurhûla gwa Larha Nnâmahanga na Nyakasane Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omunkwa n’omusengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Burhanzi mvunzire Nyamuzinda wâni omunkwa muli Yezu Kristu erhi mwe murhuma mweshi, bulya obuyêmêre bwinyu bwadesirwe omu igulu lyoshi. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Nêci, omuhamîrizi wâni ali Nnâmahanga yênene, oyu nkolera n’omurhima gwâni gwoshi nka naderha Emyanzi y’Akalembe y’Omugala, <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>amanyire oku ntahusa okumukengêra, n’oku nshenga ngasi kasanzi omu nsengero zâni nti mbone lêro amango minjà g’okuhika emwinyu, akabà Nyamuzinda alonzize. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Bulya bwenêne ncîfinjire okumubona, lyo muhâbwa oku nshôkano y’obunya-mûka y’oku­mmuzibuhya; <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>rhubone oku rhwahânana omurhima, mw’oyo nâni, omu buyêmêre bwîrhu rhweshi. <verse eid="ROM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Bene wîrhu, ntankamufulika oku nakâg’ilâlira kanji-kanji okuhika emwinyu, lyo ndya oku ntanda yinyu nk’eyimbugâna emwa abantu b’agandi mashanja; ci kuhika buno nakabona ebihânzo. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Ndi muntu w’Abagereki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abagereki, bo halya basomire, nk’Abaroma. Ci kanji-kanji, omu kanwa ka Paolo, Abagereki go mashanja g’abantu barhali Buyahudi, bo bapagani.</char></note> nk’oku ndi w’abashenzi, ndi w’abasomire n’ow’abahwinja. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>B’obu bubidu nti mmulêrhere ninyu Emyanzi y’Akalembe, mwe bantu b’e Roma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Obucunguke burhenga omu buyêmêre</para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzîne bw’omushinganyanya bubà buyêmêre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Emyanzi y’Akalembe ntayibêra nshonyi; bulya eri misî ya Nnâmahanga ociza ngasi mwemêzi, burhanzi Omuyahudi, kandi Omugereki. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Bulyâla obushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda buciyêrekana muli ye, bwo bushinganyanya burhenga omu buyêmêre bunakomeza obuyêmêre, nka kulya biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 1:1-5">Hab 1, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:1-4">2, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:38">Hbr 10, 38</ref></char>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Obuzîne bw’omushinganyanya bubà buyêmêre</char>.<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oburhè bwa Nyamuzinda oku banya-byâha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Bulyâla kurhenga empingu Nyamuzinda ayêrekana obukunizi bwâge oku ngasi bubî na ngasi bulyâlya bw’abantu bahindula obushinganyanya bwa Nnâmahanga bujà bw’obulyâlya bwâbo; <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>bulya ebyankamanyibwa bya Nnâmahanga, babimanyire: Nnâmahanga yênene abayêresirebyo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Kurhenga okulemwa kw’igulu, ebirhabonwa bikola bimanyîkana oku biremwa alemire, nk’obuhashe bwâge bw’ensiku n’amango erhi obunyamuzinda bwâge. Co cirhumire barhankabêrwa bwonjo, <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>kulya kubà bàmanyire Nnâmahanga barhanamukuzagya nka Nnâmahanga, barhanamuvugaga omunkwa; ci bôhe bàhabukira omu nkengêro za busha, n’omurhima gwâbo guhûsire gwayunjula mwizimya.<verse eid="ROM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Mpu bayengeha, kwashuba kuhwinjagala. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Erhi bahika aho, bahindula irenge lya Nyamuzinda orhankafà nshushano za muntu cibolêreza, n’ez’orhunyunyi, n’ez’ensimba zigendera oku magulu gâni n’ezigendera oku nda. <verse eid="ROM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Co càrhumire Nyamuzinda abaleka: omu kushimba enyifinjo mbî z’omurhima gwâbo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Abôla bahingîne okuli kwa Nnâmahanga eby’obunywesi, bàharâmya banakolera eciremwa ahâli ha Lulema mugishe ensiku n’amango. Amen!<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Okwo kwarhuma Nyamuzinda abakabulira omu iralà libî bwenêne: bakâbo bàleka okukolêsa emibiri yâbo oku kujira ebishingânîne, bàjira okurhakwânîni obwôrhere bw’omukazi; <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>n’abalume kwo na kwo: baleka bakâbo, bashimbana bône na bône, balume bajira oku bâbo balume ebirhankaderhwa, na ntyo bahâbwa omu mubiri gwâbo oluhembo lukwânîne obuhûrha bwâbo. <verse eid="ROM 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Bulya barhalonzagya okumanya kwinjà Nnâmahanga, Nnâmahanga naye àbakabulîre omu murhima gwâbo guhûsire n’omu bijiro birhakwânîni.<verse eid="ROM 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Bayunjwîre obubî bwa ngasi lubero: obushombanyi, okuziga eby’en’igulu, okuhusha, okucîfinja ebya bene, okunigana, ennongwè, oburhebanyi, obwengûza bubî, akalimi kabî, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>okushobeka abandi busha, okushomba Nnâmahanga, okujacirana, okucîbona, okucîkunga, okubà ntwâli omu kujira amabî, okubà bigamba, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>okubà bizùzù, ndyâlya, bamînya, n’okurhayumva lukogo. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>N’o­bwo barhahabiri irhegeko lya Nnâmahanga oku abajira ebya bene ebyo bali ba kufà, kurharhuma barhabijira bône, ciru n’okuhà abandi babijira omurhima.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku Nyamuzinda abêraga Abayahudi burhè</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Co cirhumire nâwe, ciru wankabà we ndi, orhankayêra ciru n’ehitya, we okâtwa olwa bene, bulyâla omu kutwa olwa bene, kuciyâza ociyâza; kulya kubà, wâni nyamutwa-olwa-bene, oku ajira kwo nâwe ojira. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Rhurhanahabiri oku abajira bene okwo Nyamuzinda ye batwîra olubanja lw’okuli. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Nâwe, we kâtwa emmanja z’abajira ntyo, n’obwo nâwe kw’oli akâbo, k’omanyire mpu wâfuma olubanja lwa Nyamuzinda? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Nkabaga kugayaguza ogayaguzize obuhirhi bw’obwinjà n’olukogo n’obutûdu bwâge? K’orhîshi oku obwo bwonjo bwa Nyamuzinda bukulalisire mpu ocîyunjuze? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Obûla ohûsize omurhima gwâwe orhanalonza okucîyunjuza, k’orhîshi oku odwîrhe wacihakira enguli y’obukunizi oku lusiku lwa ngerera-hano, lwo lusiku olubanja lw’okuli lwa Nyamuzinda lwânabonekane, <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>alyûle ngasi muntu nk’oku ebijiro byâge binakwânîne<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2, 6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 62:13."><ref loc="PSA 62:61--1">Lul 62(61), 13</ref></char></note>: <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>abantu bacîshwêkera oku kujira aminjà, abalonza irenge n’obukuze n’okurhafà, abashobôze obuzîne bw’ensiku n’amango; <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>nabo abagoma, balya barhakenga okuli, balya banywâna n’obubî, bâbone obukali n’obukunizi. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Obuhanya n’amalibuko garheganyizîbwe ngasi muntu ojira amabî: burhanzi Abayahudi, kandi Abagereki; <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>ci irenge n’obukuze n’omurhûla birheganyizîbwe ngasi muntu ojira aminjà: burhanzi Abayahudi, kandi Abagereki; <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>bulya Nyamuzinda arhajira kabôlo.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluhembo lw’abarhayishi Amarhegeko ci bajira aminjà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Ngasi bantu boshi bajizire kubî buzira irhegeko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irhegeko lya Mûsa.</char></note>, bafè buzira irhegeko; na ngasi bajizire kubî banamanyire irhegeko, banatwîrwe olubanja nk’oku irhegeko linadesire. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Bulya arhali abayumvîrhiza amarhegeko kwône bo bêru-kwêru embere za Nnâmahanga, ci abajira oku amarhegeko gadesire bo bayêre.<verse eid="ROM 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Ngasi mango abapagani bakulikira obwôrhere bwâbo bwinjà ciru ankaba barhagwêrhi marhegeko, bakajira ebijiro binjà, omurhima gwâbo gunabêre ahâli h’amarhegeko. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Banayêrekane oku amarhegeko gali mayandike omu murhima gwâbo; entimanya zâbo zinahamîrize ntyo, n’omurhima gwâbo hali amango gubabwîra oku bajizire kubî.<verse eid="ROM 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Kwo byabwikûke ntyo, nk’oku nyigîriza omu Myanzi yâni y’Akalembe, amango Nyamuzinda arhuma Kristu mpu atwe olubanja lw’ebifulisirwe omu mirhima y’abantu. <verse eid="ROM 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Ci kwône, we negenera okuderhwa Muyahudi, we yegemera amarhegeko, we cîkuza muli Nnâmahanga, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>we yishi obulonza bwâge, we yish’ihanûla ebiri binjà mpu we wayigîrizîbwe amarhegeko, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>we cikubagira mpu oli cirongôzi c’emihûrha, mpu oli kamole k’abâli omu mwizimya, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>we mwigîriza w’abahwinja, mwalimu w’ebirhaba mpu obwenge irhegeko likuzabûlire ebinwa by’obumanye n’eby’okuli! <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Ewani sho! oyigîriza abandi, ci orhacîyigîriza wêne! Ohanûla okurhazimba, ogal’izimba wêne! <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Ohanza okuhusha, onagal’inahusha! Onaderhe mpu oshomba enshushano z’abazimu, ogal’inakazimba omu ngombe zâbo! <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>We negenera irhegeko, ogal’inakalivuna, kugayisa ogayîsa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Nka kulya biyandisirwe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="xta" closed="false">lolà </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Iz 52, 5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:20">Eze 36, 20</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">mwe murhuma izîno lya Nnâmahanga lijâcirwa omu mashanja</char>.<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukembûlwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Okukembûlwa, nêci, kwanakulêrhera amakwânane, akabà oshimba amarhegeko; ci akabà orhashimba marhegeko, we wakembwîrwe, okola oli nk’orhakembûlagwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Omuntu orhali mukembûle, erhi akashimba amarhegeko, k’arhumânîni n’owakembwîrwe n’obwo arhakembûlagwa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>N’oyo muntu oshimba amarhegeko, ciru akabà arhali mukembûle, ayish’itwa o­lwâwe, we vuna amarhegeko n’obwo wakembwîrwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Bulya Omuyahudi arhali omu masù abonekera, n’obukembûle arhali omu mubiri bubà<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emilongo 25-26: Nyamuzinda okembûla omurhima, lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:6">Lush 30, 6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:14-16">Lush 10, 14-16</ref></char>; okukembûla omurhima, lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 4:4">Yer 4, 4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:25-29">Rom 2, 25-29</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:3">Flp 3, 3</ref></char>; obubatizo bwo bukembûle burhajiragwa na maboko ga muntu, lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:11a">Kol 2, 11a</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Omuyahudi menemene omu murhima obuyahudi bwâge bubà; n’obukembûle bw’okuli omu murhima bubà, bubà bwa murhima; ci burhabà bwa myandiko. Obukembûle bwa bene obwo burhenza obukuze, arhali emwa abantu, ci emwa Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ntâco cankacika ebi Nyamuzinda alagânaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Cici Omuyahudi alushînekwo, nîsi erhi bunguke buci okukembûlwa kumulêrhera? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Bunji bwenêne na bwa ngasi lubero! Burhanzi, bulya bayêmîre ebinwa bya Nnâmahanga ali arhanzir’ibabîsa ebinwa. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Ewe! akabà baguma muli bo bahindusire ndyâlya, k’obulyâlya bwâbo bwankarhuma Nyamuzinda arhajira ebi alagânaga? Ciru n’ehitya! <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Rhuyishi oku Nyamuzinda arhanywerha, ci ngasi muntu kujalira ajalira, nk’oku biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3, 4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:6">Lul 50, 6</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Ly’oyêra omu binwa byâwe, onayâze abakuheka lubanja</char>. <verse eid="ROM 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Ci akabà obubî bwîrhu buyêrekana obushinganyanya bwa Nyamuzinda, kurhi rhwaderhaga? Ka Nyamuzinda arhali mubî erhi arhukunirira? (Namâderha nka kula abantu baderha). <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Ciru n’ehitya! Acibâga, kurhi Nyamuzinda ali ayish’itwa olubanja lw’igulu? <verse eid="ROM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Ci akabà obunywesi bwâni buyêrekana irenge lya Nnâmahanga omu kumanyîsa oku ye Nnamuderha-okuli, cankacirhuma nganjirwa omu banya-byâha. <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Erhi kandi, nk’oku baguma barhuhambâra, cankarhuma rhurhajira amabî lyo aminjà garhengamwo? Abà bene abo bakwânîne obuhane.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntà muntu mwimâna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Kurhi birigi? Ka rhulushîne? Ciru n’ehitya! Bulya rhwadesire nti Abayahudi n’Abagereki bali banya-byâha boshi, <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>nk’oku biyandisirwe, mpu: <char style="qt">Ntà muntu mwimâna, ntâye ciru n’omuguma</char>; <verse eid="ROM 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/><char style="qt">ntà murhimanya, ntâye alonza Nyamuzinda</char>. <verse eid="ROM 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Boshi bali mihabwè<char style="qt">, boshi bahindusire babî kuguma</char>. <char style="qt">Ntà muntu ojira aminjà nanga, ntâye ciru n’omuguma</char>. <verse eid="ROM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/><char style="qt">Omumiro gwâbo eri nshinda eyashamire</char>! <char style="qt">Olulimi lwâbo luyunjwîre bulyâla</char>! <char style="qt">Marhî ga mpiri gababa omu kanwa</char>, <verse eid="ROM 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/><char style="qt">n’akanwa kâbo kayunjwîre obuhehêrere n’obukali</char>. <verse eid="ROM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/><char style="qt">Amagulu gâbo gabà mangu oku kugend’ibulaga omukò</char>; <verse eid="ROM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/><char style="qt">aha bagera bigûkà bahasiga n’obuhanya</char>. <verse eid="ROM 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/><char style="qt">Enjira y’omurhûla barhayiyishi</char>; <verse eid="ROM 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Okurhînya Nyamuzinda kurhababà ebusù<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà ecitabu c’Ennanga n’omulêbi Izaya.</char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Rhurhanahabiri oku ebiri omu Ndagâno ya mîra byoshi biyêrekîre abayihâbagwa, lyo ngasi kanwa kahulika, lyo na ngasi muntu abona oku ali mubî embere za Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Bulya embere zâge ntà muntu ciru n’omuguma wâyêre mpu okwenge ashimbire amarhegeko; kulya kubà ntà cindi amarhegeko gajira okurhali kumanyîsa ebyâha.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obucunguke n’obuyêmêre eri nshôkano ya Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Buno lêro, buzira irhegeko, Nyamuzinda ayêrekîne obwimâna bwâge buhamîrizibwa n’Irhegeko n’Abalêbi. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Obwo bwimâna bwa Nyamuzinda buhâbwa abayêmêra Yezu Kristu. Buhâbwa abemêzi boshi, bulya ntà kanânà. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Boshi bajizire ebyâha, baheza irenge lya Nyamuzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eryo irenge lya Nyamuzinda, bwo buzîne bwâge rhuhâbwa omu nshôkano y’inêma ly’obucèse.</char></note>, <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>na kandi boshi bajirwa bêru-kwêru n’engalo y’olukogo lwâge erhi bucunguzi buli muli Kristu Yezu burhuma, <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>ye Nyamuzinda acîshozire mpu abè nterekêro y’okulyûla ebyâha n’omukò gwâge erhi buyêmêre burhuma. Na ntyo ayêrekana obwimâna bwâge omu kurhahana ebyâha bya mîra, <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>amango Nyamuzinda ali atûzire; alonza okuyêrekana obwimâna bwâge mwo gano mango, mpu lyo abà muciza, anacize ngasi oyêmîre Yezu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Buyêmêre burhuma rhwacira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Cici cirhuma omuntu acîkuza? Ntâco. Irhegeko lihi lirhumire cibà ntâco? Ka lya bijiro? Nanga, ci irhegeko ly’obuyêmêre. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Bulya rhumanyire oku omuntu ajirwa mwêru-kwêru n’obuyêmêre, buzira bijiro by’amarhegeko. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Ewe! ka Nyamuzinda akolaga Nyamuzinda wa Buyahudi bône? K’arhaciri w’agandi mashanja goki? Nêci, ali w’agandi mashanja nago, <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>bulya Nyamuzinda abà muguma toro: ye wâcize abakembûle erhi buyêmêre burhuma, n’abarhali bakembûle erhi buyêmêre burhuma. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Ka rhwamakundula amarhegeko erhi buyêmêre burhuma? Kunywerha! Ciru rhuzibuhize amarhegeko erhikwo.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Olwiganyo lw’Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Kurhi rhwaderhaga kuli Abrahamu, shakulûza wîrhu w’omubiri? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Akabà Abrahamu omu bijiro byâge arhenzagya obushinganyanya, agwêrhe igwârhiro ly’okucîkunga; ci kwône arhali embere za Nyamuzinda! <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Agwârhi, kurhi Amandiko gadesire? Mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Murh 15, 6</ref>.</char></note>: Abrahamu ayêmîre Nnâmahanga, n’okwo kwarhuma abà mushinganyanya. <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Eci omuntu ahemberwa omukolo gwâge, erhali ngalo; ci kubà kulyûlwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Ci erhi akabà arhajiziri cici, ayêmêre kwône ocêsa abanya-byâha, obwo erhi buyêmêre bwâge burhumire ayêra. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Kwo Daudi adesire, mpu ali muny’iragi omuntu Nnâmahanga ashobôza obushinganyanya buzira okulola ebijiro byâge, erhi: <verse eid="ROM 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/><char style="qt">Iragi lyâbo abababalirwa ebitumulo byâbo n’ab’ebyâha byâbo bifulisirwe</char>! <verse eid="ROM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/><char style="qt">Iragi lyâge omuntu Nyakasane arhatumuza câha</char>!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 32:1-2."><ref loc="PSA 32:31-2">Lul 32(31), 1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Ewe! k’eryo iragi liri ly’abakembwîrwe bône, nîsi erhi n’abarhakembûla­gwa? Bulya rhudesire nti obuyêmêre bw’Abrahamu bwarhumire abà Mushinganyanya? <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Aligi omu bwôrhere buci erhi alolwa ntyo? K’amango ali amakembûlwa, erhi amango arhàli aj’ikembûlwa, ci embere akembûlwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Anacihâbwa obwo enzigo y’okukembûlwa mpu ebè cimanyîso c’obushinganyanya obuyêmêre àli agwêrhe embere akembûlwe bwamulerheraga. Na ntyo ahinduka îshe wa balya boshi bayêmêra barhanakembwîrwi, mpu lyo nabo bahâbwa obushinganyanya; <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>ahinduka n’îshe w’abakembûle, arhali balya banegenera kwône okukembûlwa kwâbo, ci balya bakulikira omukâba gw’obuyêmêre larha Abrahamu àli agwêrhe embere akembûlwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Ntyo, arhali marhegeko garhumaga Abrahamu boshi n’iburha lyâge alaganyibwa oku ayish’iyîma omu igulu; bushinganyanya burhenga omu buyêmêre bwarhumaga. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Bulya, akabà akashambala kali ka bene-amarhegeko, ntà kamalo obuyêmêre bucigwêrhe, n’eciragâne ciri ca busha; <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>bulyâla Irhegeko lilêrha obukunizi; ci aha irhegeko lirhali, ntà kulivuna. <verse eid="ROM 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Eco co cirhuma akashambala kalêrhwa n’obuyêmêre, mpu lyo kabà ngalo; na ntyo endagâno ekwânane iburha lyoshi, arhali elicîkubagira amarhegeko lyône, ci n’elicikubagira obuyêmêre bw’Abrahamu, larha wîrhu rhweshi, <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>nkoku biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Murh 17, 5</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Nakujizire îshe w’amashanja mwandu. Oyôla ye larha embere za Nyamuzinda, ayêmêraga oku Ye galulira abafîre obuzîne, anahamagale ebirhahali mpu bibêho</char>.<verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuyêmêre bwa Abrahamu n’obw’omukristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Omu kulangâlira ebirhankahashikana okulangalirwa, Abrahamu ayêmîre, na ntyo ahinduka îshe w’amashanja mwandu, nk’oku àli abwîzirwe, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4, 18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Murh 15, 5</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Ntyo kwo iburha lyâwe lyabà</char>. <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Buyêmêre bukomîre asinzizemwo omubiri gwâge gwàli gukola guhozire, - àli cingana myâka igana-, n’omûla gwa Sara gwàli gukola guhuhire. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Arharhindiraga erhi ayumva eciragâne ca Nyamuzinda, ci obuyêmêre bwâge bwamuzibuhya, aha Nnâmahanga irenge; <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>bulya àli amanyire buzira karhinda emurhima oku Nyamuzinda agwêrhe obuhashe bw’okuyunjuza eciragâne câge. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Ka murhabwinigi ecarhumaga okwo kumulêrhera obushinganyanya! <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Ci kwône arhali yêne wayandikîrwe mpu ahindusire mushinganyanya; <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>ci nîrhu rhweshi kukwânîne obuyêmêre burhubêre, rhweshi rhuyêmêra owafûlaga Nnawîrhu Yezu omu bafîre, <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>oyo Yezu wahânagwa byâha bîrhu birhuma, anafûka mpu lyo muyêra.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuyêmêre burhulêrhera obwimâna n’obucire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Ntyo, bulya obuyêmêre bwarhujizire bêru-kwêru, rhukola rhugwêrhe omurhûla na Nyamuzinda muli Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu, <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>warhuhisize omu njira y’obuyêmêre, lyo rhushikira eyo ngalo rhwashobwîre, rhunacîshingire obulangâlire bw’okuyish’ihika omu irenge lya Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Ci arhali hoshi aho; rhunacîshinge n’omu malibuko gîrhu, kulya kubà rhumanyire oku amalibuko galêrha obushibirizi. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>n’obushibirizi bulêrhe enkômedu nyinjà, n’enkômedu nyinjà elêrhe obulangâlire; <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>n’obo bulangâlire burhabonêsa nshonyi, bulya obuzigire bwa Nyamuzinda bwabulagîrwe omu mirhima yîrhu na Mûka Mutagatîfu rhwahâbagwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Nêci, amango rhwaciri bazamba, erhi ensiku zihika Yezu arhufîra n’obwo rhwàli byâbi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Kuli kuzibu okufîra omwêru-kwêru; nêci, nkaba kwankahashikana okugeregeza okufîra omuntu mwinjà. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Nyamuzinda yêhe ayêrekîne obuzigire bwâge kuli rhwe erhi Kristu arhufîra rhunaciri banya-byâha. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Buno lyôhe obuzigire bwâge bukola burhalusire, bulya rhukola rhuli bêru-kwêru erhi mukò gwâge gurhuma, rhwafuma obukunizi bwa Nyamuzinda erhi ye rhuma. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Bulya, akabà rhwazigîrwe na Nnâmahanga erhi lufù lw’Omugala lurhuma, n’obwo rhwaciri bashombanyi, lêro na buno rhukola rhuyinjibîne naye!, rhwâcizibwa n’obuzîne bwâge. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Arhanali kwône okwo; ci rhudwîrhe rhwacîsima muli Nnâmahanga erhi Nnawîrhu Yezu orhuma, ye warhushobôzagya okuyinjibana na Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu na Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Ntyo kwo biri! Ecâha cadwîrhwe en’igulu na muntu muguma, naco ecâha càburha olufù, n’olufù lwayahukira abantu boshi, bulya boshi bàkozire ecâha. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Ecâha càli en’igulu embere amarhegeko gahânwe, ci ecâha cirhahanirwa ndi nka nt’irhegeko lihali; <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Ci kurharhumaga olufù lurhakûla emyônè kurhenga Adamu kuhika Mûsa, lwahêka ciru n’abarhajiraga câha omu kuvuna amarhegeko ak'adamu, ye nshusho y’owanayishe. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Ci kwône engalo erhali nk’e­câha. Bulya akabà ecâha ca muguma calumîzize olufù omu lubaga, kanga kulusha engalo ya Nyamuzinda n’enshôkano y’amakwânane ga muntu muguma, Yezu Kristu, byalumîre omu bantu banji! <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>N’eyo nshôkano erhali nka bwahu­kire bw’ecâha ca muguma; bulya olubanja lw’eco câha ca muguma buhane lwadwîrhe; ci enshôkano y’olukogo Nyamuzinda àrhufaga oku byâha bîrhu binji yàrhujira bêru-kwêru. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Bulya, akabà ecâha ca muntu muguma carhumire olufù lwagandâza, erhi ye rhumire, kanga kulusha balya bayunjwîre engalo n’enshôkano y’obushinganyanya bôhe bayish’ilushîsa, bagandâze omu buzîne Yezu Kristu yênene orhumire! <verse eid="ROM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Ntyo, nk’oku bahaniragwa obubî bwa muntu muguma, kw’abantu boshi bàhindusire bêru-kwêru, banashobôla obuzîne cijiro ca bwimâna bwa muguma cirhumire. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Bulyâla, nk’oku olubaga lwoshi lwayahukiragwa n’ecâha erhi bucîbone bwa muntu muguma burhuma, kwo lwanayish’iyêra bumvi bwa muguma burhumire. <verse eid="ROM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Nêci, kwo binali, irhegeko lyàyishire mpu lyo obubî buluga; ci kwône aha ecâha càli cishurhamire, engalo ya Nyamuzinda yahalambiza; <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>mpu lyo, nk’oku ecâha càli cigandâzize omu lufù, engalo ya Nyamuzinda egandâza n’obushinganyanya omu buzîne bw’ensiku n’amango, Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu orhumire.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Rhwafîre oku câha n’obuzîne bwîrhu bukola buhyâhya muli Kristu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Kurhi rhwaderhaga? Ka rhubêre omu câha mpu lyo engalo eluga? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Ntanzi! Rhwe rhwafîre oku câha, kurhi rhwankashub’icibêramwo? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Nkaba muhabire oku rhweshi, ababatizîbwe muli Kristu, omu lufù lwâge rhwabatizîbwe? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Erhi rhubatizibwa, rhwabishwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rhwabishwa: Mîra owabatizibwa akâg’ilohwa omu mîshi, abè nk’ojire omu nshinda.</char></note> haguma naye omu lufù, nti nk’oku Kristu afûlagwa muli banyakwigendera n’irenge ly’Îshe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Irenge ly’Îshe, bwo buhashe bwâge bugala byoshi.</char></note>, lyo nîrhu rhugenda omu obuzîne buhyâhya akâge. <verse eid="ROM 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Bulya, akabà rhukola rhugwêrhe kalamo kaguma naye omu lufù lushushîne, rhwayish’ibà na kalamo kaguma naye omu bufûke bushushîne <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Rhumanyirekwo: omuntu wîrhu wa mîra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">omuntu wîrhu wa mîra, bwo bwôrhere rhwalimo erhi rhuciri banya-byâha.</char></note> abambirwe oku musalaba haguma naye, mpu ly’omubiri gw’ebyâha gushâbûka, ntyo rhurhenge omu bujà bw’ebyâha; <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>bulya owafîre erhi afumire ecâha. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Ci akabà rhwafîre haguma na Kristu rhuyêmîre kwo na kwo oku rhwâlama haguma na Kristu. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Rhumanyire oku Kristu afûsire omu balindamboho, arhakacifa bundi; ntà buhashe olufù lucigwêrhe kuli ye. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Erhi afà, ahima ecâha lwoshi-lwoshi; n’obuzîne bwâge bukola buzîne bwa kulamira Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Ninyu kwo kuguma: muyôrhe nk’abàfîre oku câha, munalamire Nyamuzinda muli Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyâke ecâha, obè mushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Lêro ecâha cirhacibonaga aha cankagandâza omu mubiri gwinyu gwayish’ifà, cilek’immuyemêza amagene gâco. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Murhajiraga ebirumbu binyu byoji by’obulyâlya omu kubikolêsa oku kujira ebyâha; ci mucîhâne mwêne emwa Nyamuzinda nka bantu bazîne bàfulumusire olufù, n’ebirumbu binyu mubikolêse nka byoji bya bushinganyanya omu kurhumikira Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Bulya ntà buhashe ecâha cicigwêrhe kuli mwe, kulya kubà murhashwêsirwi na marhegeko, ci n’engalo ya Nnâmahanga.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhashubira omu bujà bw’ecâha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Ewe! ka rhukâg’ijira ebyâha bulya rhurhashwêsirwi na marhegeko, ci n’engalo ya Nnâmahanga? Ntà mango! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Ka murhishi oku erhi mwankacîhâna bujà emwa lebè, mpu mumurhumikire, mwanabà bajà b’olya murhumikira; akabà câha, cimmulêrhere olufù, n’akabà bumvi, bummulêrhere obushinganyanya. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Ci Nyamuzinda akonkwa! Erhi mubà mwamârhenga omu bujà bw’ecâha, mwashimbire n’omurhima gwinyu gwoshi enjira y’enyigîrizo mwayigîrizîbwe; <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>n’erhi mubà mwamâlîkûzibwa oku câha, mwahinduka barhumisi b’obushinganyanya. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Ndesire nka kulya abantu baderha erhi buzamba bwinyu burhuma. Kulya mwakolêsagya ebirumbu binyu omu bujà bw’eby’enshonyi n’obugoma, mwâbà bagomi, ntyo kwo mubikolêsagye kurhenga ene omu burhumisi bw’omushinganyanya, lyo mubà bimâna.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluhembo lw’ecâha n’olw’obushinganyanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Amango mwaciri bajà b’ecâha, nt’irhegeko lyàli limmushwêsire. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Bunguke buci mwabwînage obwo? Buno enshonyi zimmubambisire, bulya obuzinda bw’ebyo byoshi lubà lufù. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Ci buno mwalikûzîbwe oku câha, mukola bambali ba Nnâmahanga, obutagatîfu lwo luhembo lwinyu, n’obuzinda bwinyu buli buzîne bw’ensiku n’amango. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Bulya oluhembo lw’ecâha lubà lufù, ci engalo ya Nyamuzinda bubà buzîne bw’ensiku n’amango muli Nnâhamwîrhu Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuyêmêre burhurhenza omu bujà bw’Irhegeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>K’erhi muhabire, bene wîrhu -bantu balenga omu marhegeko nabwira- oku irhegeko lishwêka omuntu amango acizîne? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Ntyo omukazi ashwêsirwe n’irhegeko kuli ibà amango ibà acizîne; ci erhi ibà ankafà, nyamukazi anashwêkûlwa n’irhegeko ly’ibà. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Kuziga amango ibà acizîne, erhi ankayankwa n’owundi mulume, anaderhwa mugonyi; ci erhi ibà ankafà, arhacishwêsirwi n’irhegeko, na ntyo arhaciri mugonyi erhi ankayankwa n’owundi mulume. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Ninyu kwo na kwo, bene wîrhu: mwafîre, mwarhenzibwa omu lukoba lw’amarhegeko erhi mubiri gwa Kristu gurhuma, mpu mubè ba wundi, olya wafûkaga omu bafîre, mpu lyo rhukafulukiza Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Erhi rhuciri omu mubiri, amîru g’e­byâha, galêrhwa n’amarhegeko, gakâg’ijira omukolo gwâgwo omu birumbu bîrhu, mpu lyo rhukafulukiza olufù. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Ci buno rhwafîre oku byakâg’irhushwêka nka mpira, rhwarhenzîbwe omu lukoba lw’amarhegeko, rhukola rhwakolera oku ngoma mpyâhya y’omurhima, ci arhaciri oku ngoma y’ecikulakula ya «shimba-oku-bàdesire».<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bici Amarhegeko galêrha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Kuli kuderha kurhi? Ka mpu irhegeko liri câha? Ntanzi! Ci kwônene ntamanyaga ecâha elirhali irhegeko lirhumire, Bulya ntankamanyire amagene irhegeko lirhâciderhaga, mpu: <char style="qt">Orhakazâg’ibà magene</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Orhakaz’ibà magene, kuli kutwa bwofi ebinwa bibà omu <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Lub 20, 17</ref></char>.</char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Erhi ecâha cibona ntyo, canshulira amîru ga ngasi lubero erhi irhegeko lirhuma. Bulya buzira irhegeko, ecâha guli mufù. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Nêci, mîra nalamaga buzira marhegeko; ci erhi amarhegeko gayisha, ecâha naco cafulûluka, <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>nâni nabaga nie nfà. Ntyo amarhegeko gàl’ikwânîne okumpà obuzîne, gabà lufù lwo ganderhera. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Bulya erhi ecâha cibona amarhegeko, cantiza, cananniga erhi gwo garhuma. <verse eid="ROM 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Kuziga amarhegeko gali mimâna, n’ebirhegesirwe biri bimâna, bishingânîne, binali binjà. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>K’akantu kinjà kàbirage lufù kuli nie? Ntà mango! Câha eco candwîrhîre olufù omu kukolêsa akantu kinjà, mpu lyo ciyêrekana oku ciri câha, na ntyo mpu lyo cibà cibî kulusha erhi marhegeko garhuma.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuntu abà muzamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Rhukumanyire, nêci: irhegeko kali kantu ka bunya-mûka; ci niehe ndi kantu ka bunya-mubiri, mugulwa, mujà w’ecâha. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Nanga, okuli, ebinjira ntabiyumva; bulya arhali ebinnonza okujira byo njira, ci ebi nshomba byo njira. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Akabâga ebi ntalonza okujira byo njira, kuziga nyêmîre oku irhegeko liri linjà. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Ahoo! kuziga arhaciri nie nkujira, ci ecâha cimbâmwo. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Nkumanyire, nêci! obwinjà burhambâmwo, kwo kuderha omu mubiri gwâni. Okulonza aminjà, nêci nanakuhasha; ci okugajira nie hâhè. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Bulya ntajira aminjà nnonzize, ci obubî ntalonzizi bwo njira. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Akabà ebintalonzizi okujira byo njira, kuziga arhaciri nie mbijira, ci ecâha cindimwo. <verse eid="ROM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Alagi irhegeko namârhindakwo: nie ono nkalonz’ijira aminjà, obubî nanabona bwo buyishire. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Nêci, nnanyumve nsîmire amarhegeko ga Nnâmahanga omu murhima gwâni; <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>ci omu birumbu byâni nyumve erindi irhegeko lihêrhe lyalwîsa irhegeko ly’obukengêre bwâni n’okunjira mpira y’irhegeko ly’ecâha cindi omu birumbu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Lêro nieki ihanja lici limbâkwo! Ndi wandîkûza kw’ogu mubiri gw’olufù? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Akonkwa Nnâmahanga muli Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu! Ntyo, nie ono omu bukengêre ndwîrhe nakolera irhegeko lya Nyamuzinda, n’ery’ecâha omu mubiri.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Obuzîne bw’omukristu muli Mûka Mutagatîfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Ntà kuciyagiriza abâli muli Yezu Kristu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Bulya irhegeko ly’Omûka guhâna obuzîne muli Yezu Kristu lyakulîkûzize oku irhegeko ly’ecâha n’ery’olufù. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Bulya ebi amarhegeko garhahashaga erhi buzamba bwa mubiri burhuma, Nyamuzinda yêne abijizire erhi arhuma Omugala omu mubiri gushushire ogwîrhu gw’ebyâha, mpu lyo ahima ecâha, n’omu mubiri gwâge, ayagîriza ecâha, <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>mpu ly’obushinganyanya bw’amarhegeko bubà muli rhwe, rhwe olugendo lwîrhu lurhashimba mubiri, ci mûka. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Nêci, abashimha engeso z’omubiri, bya mubiri bashwîra, n’abashimba omûka, bya mûka bashwîra. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Bulya enyifinjo z’omubiri luli lufù, ci enyifinjo z’omûka kali kalamo n’omurhûla. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Co cirhuma enyifinjo z’omubiri zishomba Nnâmahanga, bulya zirhashimba irhegeko lya Nnâmahanga; ciru zirhankanahasha okulishimba. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Abashimba eby’omubiri barhankasîmîsa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ROM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Mwêhe murhali bashimbi ba mubiri, ci bashimbi ba mûka, kulya kubà Omûka gwa Nyamuzinda gubà muli mwe. Orhagwêrhi Omûka gwa Kristu arhali wa Kristu. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Ci akabà Kristu ammulimwo, ciru omubiri gukabà gukola gufîre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kurhenga omuntu ajira ecâha, omubiri gwâge gukola gwa kufà, gunakola gurhuma olufù lwamuhika omu mûka, erhi ankajira ecâha cinene; ci Mûka Mutagatîfu yêhe ali buzîne n’imerero ly’obufûke.</char></note> erhi câha cirhuma, omûka gôhe guzîne obushinganyanya burhumire. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>N’akabà Omûka gw’Olya wafûsagya Yezu omu bafù gubà muli mwe, olya wafûsagya Yezu Kristu omu bafù ayahe emibiri yinyu y’okufà akalamo oku buhashe bwa Mûka ommubâmwo. <verse eid="ROM 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Ntyôla, bene wîrhu, rhuli omu mwenda, ci gurhali mwenda gwa mubiri mpu rhwalamira omubiri. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Bulya mukalamira omubiri, mwâfà; ci mukâyîrha ebijiro by’omubiri n’ohuhashe bwa Mûka, mwâlama.<verse eid="ROM 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Rhuli bâna ha Nyamuzinda, Mukà Mutagatîfu orhumire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Nêci, kwo binali, abahêkwa na Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda omu lugendo lwâbo babà bâna ba Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Murhahâbagwa murhima gwa bajà mpu mwayôboha; mwahîrwe omurhima gw’abâna balere, gwo gunarhuma rhwayâkûza, nti: «Abba, Larha!» <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Mûka Mutagatîfu yênênè anajè omu murhima gwîrhu oku kuhamîriza oku rhuli bâna ba Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Obwo rhuli bâna bâge, rhwe rhwâyîme; rhuli mîmo ya Nnâmahanga, rhwâyîme rhweshi na Kristu, bulya rhuli omu malibuko rhweshi naye lyo rhuyish’ikuzibwa haguma naye.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amalibuko g’en’igulu n’obukuze rhubikîrwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Nêci, mbwîne niehe oku amababale g’en’igulu garhankagererwa oku bukuze rhwayish’ihâbwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Bulya ebiremwa byoshi bidwîrhe byalingûza oku abâna ba Nnâmahanga bacîyêrekana. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Ebiremwa byahizirwe omu bujà, arhali oku bulonza bwâbyo, ci oku bulonza bw’owabihiragamwo; kwône bicilangalîre <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>oku nabyo byayish’irhenzibwa omu bujà bw’obubî, bishangîre irenge ly’entagengwa ly’abâna ba Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Rhumanyire kwinjà oku kuhika ene ebiremwa byoshi biri omu mulenge, binadwîrhe byalumwa n’emikero y’okuburha. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Arhanali byône; ciru nîrhu, rhwe rhugwêrhe ecikinja<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ecikinja ca Mûka, bwo buzîne bwa Nyamuzinda, yo mburho y’irenge rhwâfûkemwo.</char></note> ca Mûka, omurhima gwîrhu gwîrhu omu mulenge guli, rhudwîrhe rhwalinda okuhinduka bâna balere n’obucunguzi bw’emibiri yîrhu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Bulya obucunguzi bwîrhu buciri bulangâlire; n’okubona eci omuntu alangâlîre burhaciri bulangâlire. Eci omuntu abwîne, kurhi ankacicilangâlira? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Ci erhi rhwankalangâlira ebirhurhahona, rhwanabilinda buzira kurhama. <verse eid="ROM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Kwo na kwo Mûka Mutagatîfu anarhabâle obuzamba bwîrhu; bulya rhurhish’ishenga okushingânîne; ci Mûka Mutagatîfu yêne orhusengerera omu njamu zirhagwêrhi oku zankaderhwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Naye Olya ovuhûla emirhima ayishi ebi Mûka alonza: amanyire oku Mûka asengerera abimâna nk’oku Nyamuzinda akunda.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzigire bwa Nyamuzinda kuli rhwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Kandi rhumanyire oku Nyamuzinda akolêsa byoshi oku minjà g’abamukunda, balya yêne ahamagîre oku bulonza bwâge. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Bulya halya yêne acîshogaga kurhenga mîra, abarheganyize mpu babè nshusho y’Omugala, lyo abà nfula omu balumuna banji; <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>n’abarheganyize, àbahamagîre; n’abahamagîre, abajizire bêru-kwêru, n’abajizire bêru-kwêru, abahîre obukuze.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mucîvugire obuzigire bwa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Cici rhwankaciyûshûla kw’ebyo? Akabà Nyamuzinda ali olunda lwîrhu, ndi wankacirhuhima? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Arhababaliraga Omugala, ci amuhâna nterekêro kuli rhwe rhweshi; bici ankacibula bwarhuha haguma naye? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Ndi wankaciderha mpu ahêka abarhôle ba Nyamuzinda lubanja? Nyamuzinda yêne ye obayêza! <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Ndigi wankacibayagiriza? Ka Yezu Kristu wafâga anafûka? Ka Yezu Kristu otamîre ekulyo kwa Nyamuzinda, odwîrhe arhulagira? <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Ndi wankacirhukûla omu buzigire bwa Kristu? Ka kubula eci rhwâyambala, erhi kaga, nîsi erhi ngôrho? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8, 36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:23">Lul 44, 23</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">We rhuma rhwayîrhwa bwâca bwayira; kwo bakola barhulola nka bibuzi byaj’ibâgwa</char>. <verse eid="ROM 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Ci kwônene mw’ebyo byoshi rhunahime erhi Olya orhuzigira orhuma. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Nêci, mmanyire kwinjà oku ciru olufù erhi buzîne, ciru bamalahika erhi amâmi, ciru gano mango erhi amango gâyi­sha, ciru amahashe, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>oli emalunga, oli omu idaho ntà ciremwa ciru n’eciguma cankahasha okurhunanûla oku buzigire bwa Nyamuzinda buli muli Nnâhamwîrhu Yezu Kristu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Enshobôlo z’Israheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Ndesire okuli muli Kristu, ntabesha, n’omurhima gwâni ye muhamîrizi wâni muli Mûka Mutagatîfu: <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>ngwêrhe burhè bunji n’amababale garhahusa omu murhima. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Nêci, nankasîmire niene nkagwe nnantenzibwekwo Kristu erhi bene wîrhu bàrhuma, balya b’omu ishanja lyâni ly’omubiri; <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>bo bene-Israheli: bo Nyamuzinda acîshozire mpu babè bâna bâge anayêrakane irenge lyâge muli bo; bo bahîrwe endagâno n’amarhegeko n’emigenzo y’okukolera Nyamuzinda n’eciragâne câge. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Bashakulûza bâli b’omu ishanja lyâbo; n’oku maburhwa g’omubiri, Kristu ali wa kuli bo, ye mwâmi mukulu w’ebintu byoshi, ye Nyamuzinda mugishe emyâka n’emyâka. Amen!<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyamuzinda arhagalula akanwa kâge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Arhali kuderha oku akanwa ka Nyamuzinda kakubire; bulya arhali ababurhagwa n’Israheli boshi bo bene-Israheli, <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>arhanali abarhengaga omu nda y’Abrahamu boshi bo bâna bâge; ci kuli Izaki iburha lyâwe lyârhenza izîno<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Murh 21, 12</ref>.</char></note>; <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>kwo kuderha oku abâna b’omubiri arhali bo bâna ba Nnâmahanga, ci abâna b’eciragâne bône lyo iburha ly’okuli. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Yumvagi oku eciragâne cidesire<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Murh 18, 10</ref>.<ref loc="GEN 18:14">14</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Hano nshub’igera mw’aga mango, erhi Sara agwêrhe omwâna w’oburhabâna</char>. <verse eid="ROM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Arhanali okwôla kwône. Rebeka naye arhôzire izîmi lya mulume muguma yêne, ye larha Izaki. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Erhi abâna babà barhaj’iburhwa, barhaj’ijira oli ecinjà oli ecibî, mpu lyo Nnâmahanga ayêrekana oku ajira nk’oku alonzize omu kucîshoga abâge, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>oku arhalola bijiro, ci bulonza bw’owahamagala yêne, anacibwirwa, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Murh 25, 23</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Enfula yanashiga omuziba, </char> <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>nk’oku biyandisirwe mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mal 1, 2-3</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Narhonyize Yakôbo, nashomba Ezau</char>. Nyamuzinda anahash’ijira nk’oku alonzize <verse eid="ROM 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Kurhi rhwaderhaga? Ka Nyamuzinda ankabamwo obulyâlya? Ntà mango! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Kali yêne wabwîraga Mûsa, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Lub 33, 19</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Mbabalira oyu nnonzize okubabalira, nnambera lukogo oyu nnonzize okubêra lukogo</char>. <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Kuziga birhali bya kulonza erhi bya kulibirha kwa muntu, ci bya bwonjo bwa Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Kandi Amandiko gàbwizire Faraoni mwâmi w’e Mîsiri, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Lub 9, 16</ref>. </char></note>: <char style="qt">Nakuyimikaga nti nkuyêrekanemwo obuhashe bwâni, lyo n’izîno lyâni likuzibwa omu igulu lyoshi</char>. <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Ntyôla, anababalire oyu alonzize, n’oyu alonzize okudundaguza amudundaguze. <verse eid="ROM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Okolaga wambwîra, erhi: «Cirhuma acicîduduma? Ndi wankalahira okujira ebi alonzize?» <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>We muntu, oligi ndi mpu wajîsa Nyamuzinda kadali? K’akantu omuntu abumbaga kankamubwîra, erhi: «Carhumaga wanjira ntya?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>K’omubumbi arhankakolêsa ibumba lyâge nk’oku alonzize, n’okurhenza mw’eryo ibumba liguma akantu kinjinja n’akantu ka ntyantya? <verse eid="ROM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Naye Nnâmahanga, omu kuyêrekana obukunizi bwâge n’okumanyîsa obuhashe bwâge, akabà alêmbîre n’obutûdu bunji ebiremwa bikwânîne obukunizi byàli hôfi h’okuberereka, <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>akabà alonzize okuyêrekana obuhirhi bw’obukuze bwâge oku biremwa by’olukogo yêne ali ayôsire arheganyîze obukuze. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>N’ebyo biremwa by’olukogo byo rhwe ahamagalaga, arhali omu Buyahudi bône, ci n’omu bapagani. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Kwo adesire omu kanwa ka Hozeya, erhi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Loammi», izîno lya mwâna wa Hozeya, lidesire «orhali lubaga lwâni»: <char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hoz 2, 23</ref></char></char></note>: <char style="qt">Nayîrika lubaga lwâni abarhâli lubaga lwâni, na murhonyi wâni orhàli murhonyi</char>; <verse eid="ROM 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>n’aha babwîriragwa, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:25">Hoz 2, 25</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 2:1">2, 1</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Murhali lubaga lwâni, abo bônene baderhwe bene Nyamuzinda ozîne</char>. <verse eid="ROM 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Naye Izaya aderhîre Israheli, erhi: <char style="qt">ciru bene-Israheli bankaluga nka mushenyi gw’omu nyanja, obusigale bwône bwânacizibwe</char>; <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/><char style="qt">bulya Nyakasane ayunjuza duba na buzira kushubira nyuma akanwa kâge omu igulu</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Iz 10, 22-23</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Kandi Izaya àli erhi alêbire, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Iz 1, 9</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Acibâga Nyakasane w’Emirhwe arharhulekeraga iburha, singa rhwabîre okwa Sodomo, singa rhwashushire Gomora</char>. <verse eid="ROM 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Kurhi rhwaderhaga? Rhuderhe oku abapagani barhashimbaga bushinganyanya bashikîrîre obushinganyanya, bwo bushinganyanya burhenga omu buyêmêre; <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Ci bene-Israheli bôhe bakâg’ishimba irhegeko ly’obushinganyanya, ery’irhegeko barhalihikakagakwo. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Carhumire? Bulya barhacîkubagiraga buyêmêre, ci bacîkubagira ebijiro, na ntyo basârhala oku ibuye ly’okusârhaza, <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>nka kulya biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9, 33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Iz 28, 16</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Ka murhabwîni oku mpizire omu Siyoni ibuye ly’okusârhaza n’ibuye ly’okuhirimya? Ci oliyêmîre arhankabonesibwa nshonyi</char>.<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Abayahudi barhamanyiriraga obushinganyanya bwa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Bene wîrhu, eci omurhima gwâni gucîfinja n’ecinsengerera emwa Nyamuzinda: nti nabo bacunguke. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Nêci mpamîrizize oku bashîbirira Nnâmahanga, ci obushiru bwâbo burhali oku bushingânîne okubà. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Bulyâla barhamanyiriraga obushinganyanya bwa Nnâmahanga, ci balonza obwâbo bushinganyanya, na ntyo balahira okushimba obushinganyanya bwa Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Bulya obushwinjiro bw’Irhegeko, ye Kristu, ye nayêza ngasi mwemêzi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Oku bushinganyanya burhenga omu marhegeko Mûsa ayandisire, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18, 5</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Omuntu wâbushimbe, bunamulamye</char>. <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Ci obushinganyanya burhenga omu buyêmêre kwo budesire ntyâla, mpu: <char style="qt">Orhaderhaga omu murhima gwâge, mpu: Ndi wankasôkera omu irunga?</char> Kwo kuderha mpu agend’imanulamwo Kristu; <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>nîsi, erhi: <char style="qt">Ndi wankayandagalira omu kuzimu?</char> Kwo kuderha mpu aj’iyinamula Kristu omu bafù. <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Bici budesirage obwo? Mpu: <char style="qt">Oluderho luli hôfi nâwe, lukuli, omu kanwa n’omu murhima</char>; n’olwo luderho bwo bugo bw’obuyêmêre rhuyigîriza. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Bulya, akabà omu kanwa kâwe onahamîrize oku Yezu ye Nyakasane, n’akabà oyêmîre omu murhima gwâwe oku Nyamuzinda amufûsize omu bafù, wâcunguka. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Nêci, obuyêmêre bw’omu murhima bwo buhisa omuntu oku obushinganyanya, n’obuhamîrize bw’akanwa bwo buhisa omuntu oku bucunguzi. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>K’Amandiko garhadesiri, mpu: <char style="qt">Ngasi yêshi omuyêmîre arhakabona nshonyi?</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Bulya ntà kabôlo ekarhî k’Abayahudi n’Abagereki: ali Nyakasane muguma, mwâmi wa boshi, ye shobôza abamushenga boshi; <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>bulya<char style="qt">ngasi yêshi wânashenge izîno</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:5">Yow 3, 5</ref>.</char></note> <char style="qt">lya Nyakasane anacire</char>.<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Ci kwône kurhi bankamushenga barhanamuyêmîri? Na kurhi ba­nkayêmêra oyu barhasâg’iyumva? Na kurhi bankayumva akabà ntâye wâbabwîriza? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Na kurhi bankaja bahanûla barhanarhumirwi? Kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Iz 52, 7</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Oku amagulu g’abajà-bugo b’emyanzi y’akalembe gayinjiha! </char> <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Ci kwône arhali boshi bayankirîre Emyanzi y’Akalembe. Izaya akudesire, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Iz 53, 1</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Yâgirwa, ndi wayêmîre obugo bwîrhu?</char> <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Ntyo obuyêmêre omu kuhanûla burhenga, n’o­kuhanûla kujirwa n’akanwa ka Kristu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Ci nâni ndôsize: «Ka barhayumvagya?» Nêci mâshi! <char style="qt">Ciru n’izù lyâbo lyayumvîkîne</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 19:5."><ref loc="PSA 19:18--1">Lul 19(18), 5</ref></char></note> omu igulu lyoshi, n’enderho zâbo zahisire ngasi habà muntu. <verse eid="ROM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Nshubir’idôsa: <char style="qt">K’Israheli arhayumvagya bwinjà</char>? Mûsa ye murhanzi w’okushuza, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Lush 32, 21</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Nammuyumvîsa obumvu oku ishanja lirhàli ishanja</char>, <char style="qt">nâmmuzûsâmwo obukunizi oku ishanja lirhajira bukengêre</char>. <verse eid="ROM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Ciru Izaya arhayôbohaga okuderha, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Iz 65, 1</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Abarhakâg’innonza bo bambwîne, abarhakâg’indôsa bo naciyêresire</char>. <verse eid="ROM 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Ci bene-Israheli ababwîra, erhi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10, 21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Iz 65, 2</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Omulegerege gwoshi, olu lubaga lurhumva lunali lugoma, nalulambûlîre amaboko</char>.<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Israheli arhakabuliragwa lwoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Ka ndôsagye: «Ka Nyamuzinda akabulirage ishanja lyâge»? Ciru n’ehitya! Ka nieki ntali mwene-Israheli, w’omu iburha ly’Abrahamu na w’omu bûko bwa Benyamini? <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Nnâmahanga arhakabuliraga olubaga lwâge acîshogaga kurhenga mîra. Nkabaga kuhaba muhabire kurhi Amandiko gadesire kuli Eliya erhi acîduduma emwa Nnâmahanga mpu alega Israheli? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>Erhi: <char style="qt">Yâgirwa, bayîsire abalêbi bâwe, bahongola ngasi lûsho lwâwe; nâni niene ncisigîre, banadwîrhe balonza okunyîrha</char>. <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Na cici Nyamuzinda amushuzize? Erhi: <char style="qt">Nacîshozire bantu bihumbi nda barhagonyeraga Baali idwi. </char> <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Ntyo kuhika ene hacisigîre abantu bacîshozirwe n’enshôkano ya Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Ci akabà eri nshôkano, birhaciri bijiro birhumire; n’acibâga arhàli ntyo, e­nshôkano erhankacibire nshôkano.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Kurhi rhwaderhaga? Eci Israheli alonza, arhasag’icibona; ci abacibwîne banali bîshogwa. Abandi badundaguzibwa, <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>nk’oku biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11, 8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:3">Lush 29, 3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Iz 29, 10</ref>. </char></note>: <char style="qt">Nyamuzinda abahîre omurhima gw’obungolongolo, abahà amasù g’olubwibwi n’amarhwîri g’ebihuli kuhika ene</char>. <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Naye Daudi acîderhîre, mpu: <char style="qt">Ecîbo câbo cibabêre isî, cihinduke murhego, cibè ibuye ly’okusârhaza, lunabè lwo luhembo lwâbo</char>! <verse eid="ROM 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/><char style="qt">Amasù gâbo gajemwo olubwibwi ganahûrhe</char>! <char style="qt">Obaherhe omugongo</char>, <char style="qt">barhacifaga</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11, 10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 69:23-24."><ref loc="PSA 69:68-24">Lul 69(68), 23-24</ref></char></note> <char style="qt">bayinamusire</char>!<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Nâni ndôsizagye: «Ka kusârhala kwarhumire bahirima?» Kubesha! Ci okuhirima kwâbo kwabîre bucire bw’abapagani, mpu lyo bayumva obwâgalwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>N’akabà okuhirima kwâbo kwahindusire buhirhi bw’igulu, n’obukenyi bwâbo bwâbà buhirhi bw’abapagani, hano bagaluka ntuliri, ka barhahagaze kulusha? <verse eid="ROM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Co cirhumire mmubwîra, mwe bapagani, oku mbà ntumwa y’abapagani, n’obugo bwâni nnonza bujè irenge, <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>nti lyo nzûsa obumvu bwa bene wîrhu b’ishanja lyâni, nnambacungulemwo baguma-baguma. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Bulya, akabà okukagwa kwâbo kwadwîrhe omulungano gw’igulu, bici okugaluka kwâbo kwayish’ibà, kurhacibiri kufûka omu bafù?<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Kali enshano ekaba nyinjà, obuntu bwoshi bunabè bwinjà; n’omuzî erhi gwankabà mwinjà, amashami nago ganayinjihe. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Akabà hali amashami gatwîrwe, nâwe we murhi gw’emuzirhu wabà we hirwa ahâli hâgo, washangîra amagoba garhenga omu cikundukundu c’omuzêti, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>omanye wankalimbira amashami. N’okuderha mpu walimba, okengêre oku arhali we hêka ecikundukundu, ci ecikundukundu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ecikundukundu co cigundu c’omuzêti batwagakwo amashami bashwêkerakwo agarhenga emuzirhu: muli Kristu abemêzi Buyahudi bayûshulwakwo abemêzi barhenga omu gandi mahanga, lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 2:19-22">Efz 2, 19-22</ref></char>.</char></note> co cikuhêka. <verse eid="ROM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Nêci, wanaderha, erhi: «K’amashami garhatubagwa mpu lyo nnjà ahâli hâgo?» <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Ntyo kwo biri! Gatwîrwe erhi kubula obuyêmêre kurhuma, nâwe buyêmêre bwarhumire wahabêra. Omanye wankacibona; ci oyôbohe erhikwo. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Bulya, akabà Nyamuzinda arhababaliraga amashami mamerêra, ka we ababalira? <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Kuziga omanye obwinjà n’obukali bwa Nyamuzinda: bukali kuli balya bahirimire, bwinjà bwa Nyamuzinda kuli we, casinga obêre mwo obwo bwinjà; akabà arhali ntyo, nâwe kutûbwa wanayish’itûbwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Nabo bakabà barhabêziri omu kubula obuyêmêre kwâbo, abashubiza omu mashami g’omurhi; bulya Nnâmahanga arhankabula obuhashe bw’okushub’ibashubizamwo. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Akabà w’oyo watwîrwe oku muzêti gw’erubala wameragakwo, wahirwa oku muzêti mwinjà gurhali gw’enkomoka yâwe, kurhi bôhe bankabulaga kwahirwa oku muzêti gw’imerero lyâbo?<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Nanga, bene wîrhu, ntalonza muhabe eri ihwe, nti lyo murhang’icîkubagira obushinganyanya bwinyu: baguma muli bene-Israheli bayôrha bali bagoma kuhika abapagani bayishe ntuliri. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Na ntyôla Israheli yêshi âcunguka, nk’oku biyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hashushire hitya <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 46:13">Iz 46, 13</ref></char>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Omuciza arhenga e Siyoni</char>; <char style="qt">ye warhenza obubî muli Yakôbo</char>. <verse eid="ROM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/><char style="qt">Yo ndagâno yâni rhweshi nabo eyo</char>, <char style="qt">amango narhenza ebyâha byâbo</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11, 27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Iz 59, 20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yer 31, 31-34</ref>.</char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Nêci, rhukalola Emyanzi y’Akalembe, bali bashombanyi erhi mwe mu­rhuma; ci rhukalola okubacîshogagwa, bali barhonyi erhi bashakulûza bâbo bàrhuma. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda akashobôza omuntu n’akamuhamagala, arhacigalula akanwa kâge. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Nka kulya mîra mwakâg’igomera Nnâmahanga, na bunôla mwababalîrwe erhi bugomi bwâbo burhuma, <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>nabo kwo na kuguma, bunôla bali bagomi erhi obwonjo mwaberîrwe burhuma, mpu lyo nabo bayish’ibabalirwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Bulya Nyamuzinda ashwêkîre abantu boshi omu bugomi, mpu lyo ababêra obwonjo boshi.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paolo acîtakirira obushinganyanya n’olukogo lwa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>O! (yâga) we, nnakagali w’obugale n’obushinganyanya n’obumanye bwa Nyamuzinda! Oku emihigo yâge erhamanyîkana kwo n’enjira zâge zirhayumvikana! <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/><char style="qt">Ye ndi okola omanyire enkengêro za Nyakasane</char>? <char style="qt">Ndi okola ojire omu ihano lyâge</char>? <verse eid="ROM 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/><char style="qt">Ndi okola omugabîre mpu ayish’imugalulira?</char> <verse eid="ROM 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Bulya byoshi emwâge birhenga, ye rhuma bihabà, binabà byâge. Ajè irenge emyâka n’e­myâka. Nêci, ntyo!<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Okufundika</para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhinduka nterekêro y’okusîmîsa Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Bene wîrhu, mmuhîre ihano erhi bwonjo bwa Nyamuzinda burhuma, nti muhâne emibiri yinyu nka nterekêro y’obuzîne, ntagatîfu n’ey’okusîmîsa Nnâmahanga. Ntyôla kwo mukwânîne okukolera Nnâmahanga n’omurhima. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Mumanye mwankacîgererakwo er’igulu, ci muhinduke bantu bahyâhya omu murhima gwinyu, lyo mumanyîrira obulonza bwa Nnâmahanga; mumanye aminjà, ebi akunda n’ebishingânîne lwoshi.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwîrhôhye n’obuzigire omu cinyabuguma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Enshôkano nahîrwe erhumire, mbwîzire ngasi muguma muli mwe nti murhakâg’icîgenza okulushire olugero, ci mucîlole okunakwânîne, nk’oku Nnâmahanga anagabîre ngasi muguma erhi amushobôza obuyêmêre. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Bulya, nka kulya omu mubiri muguma rhujiramwo birumbu binji, na kulya ebirumbu byoshi birhajira mukolo muguma, <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>nîrhu ntyo kwo rhuli banji, ci erhi rhunali mubiri muguma muli Kristu, na ngasi muguma ali cirumbu c’abâbo. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Kandi rhwahîrwe enshôkano zirhali kuguma, ngasi muguma nk’oku anashobwîre. Owahîrwe enshôkano y’obulêbi, ayikolêse nk’oku obuyêmêre bunadesire; <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>owahîrwe enshôkano y’okurhumikira abâbo, arhumike kwinjà; owahîrwe e­nshôkano y’okuyigîriza, ayigîrize; <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>owahîrwe ey’okuhanûla, ahanûle. Owarhabâla abakenyi, arhageraga; okulîre abâbo, abashîbirire; owababalira owâbo, amubabalire n’enshagali. <verse eid="ROM 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Obuzigire bwinyu burhabâgamwo bulyâlya. Mushombe amabî, mucîshwêkere oku minjà. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Muzigirane nk’abalondana; ngasi muguma akakenga abâbo nk’abamukulîre. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Mubè ba bushiru buzira bwôlo, mubè n’emirhima mikombêdu, murhumikire Nyakasane. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Mushagaluke omu bulangâlire, murhadundaganaga omu mango g’amalibuko, mushenge burhahusa. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Mukârhabâla abatagatîfu omu bulangâlire bwâbo, mukâhandîsa ebigolo.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzigira abantu boshi, ciru n’abashombanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Mukâgisha abammulibuza; mukâhâna obwangà, murhanahîra mu­kahehêrera ndi. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Mukâshagaluka n’abashagalusire, munalake haguma n’abà­laka. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Mukâlolana kuguma mwêne na nnene. Murhakâg’ilonza okukulira abandi; ci musîme obwîrhôhye. Murhacîjiraga bîrhonzi omu masù ginyu mwêne. <verse eid="ROM 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Mumanye mwankagalulira omuntu obubî oku bundi. Mukâlonza okujira aminjà embere z’abantu boshi. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Erhi kwankahashikana, mucîsêze okubà n’omurhûla n’abantu boshi. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Murhakâg’icihôla mwenene, bîra bâni, ci muleke obukunizi bwa Nyamuzinda bwône buyish’icihôla, bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12, 19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Lush 32, 35</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Okucîhôla kuli kwâni! Niene nayîsh’ilyûla ngasi muntu nk’oku akwânîne</char>. <char style="qt">Nyakasane okudesire</char>. <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/><char style="qt">Ci omushombanyi</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12, 20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Mig 25, 21-22</ref>.</char></note> <char style="qt">wâwe erhi ankashalika</char>, <char style="qt">onamushalûle</char>; <char style="qt">akabà agwêrhwe n’enyôrha</char>, <char style="qt">onamuhè eci anywa</char>. Okumujirira ntyo kuli kulunda amakala g’omuliro oku irhwe lyâge. <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Omanye wankahimwa n’obubî, ci ohime obubî omu kujira aminjà.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuyumva abarhegesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Ngasi muntu akayumva abarhegesi bamukulîre; bulya ntà bukulu burharhenga emwa Nnâmahanga, n’amarhegesi ganahabà goshi Nyamuzinda yêne wagajiraga. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Ntyôla, ngasi ogomera omurhegesi, erhi irhegeko lya Nnâmahanga agomîre, n’abagoma bône bacîlêrhere obuhane. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Abarhegesi barhali ba kuyôbohwa n’abajira aminjà, ci abajira amabî bo bakwânîne okubayôboha. K’olonzize okurhayôboha abarhegesi? Okâjira aminjà, bakusîma, <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>bulya abo barhegesi Nnâmahanga wabarhumaga mpu bakujirire aminjà. Ci erhi wankakola amabî, oyôbohe; bulyâla arhali busha bahêkera engôrho. Bali ntumwa za Nyamuzinda na baganda b’obukunizi bwâge balyûza abakola amabî. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Kuziga kukwânîne okubayumva, arhali bwôba bwône burhumire, ci n’izù ly’omu murhima lirhumire. <verse eid="ROM 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Kwo kunarhuma mwavurha okwo; bulya abarhegesi kwo banali nka baganda ba Nnâmahanga bajira omukolo gwâbo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Mukâhà ngasi muguma ebi anakwânîne: omuvurhîsa, mumuvurhire; omuhôza, mumuhè ihôro; ow’okurhînywa, mumurhînye; n’okwânîne okukuzibwa, mumukuze.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuzigire lyo ishwinjiro ly’amarhegeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Murhabêraga omu mwenda gw’omuntu aha nyuma ly’omwenda gw’obuzigire; bulya ozigîre abâbo erhi ayunjuzize amarhegeko goshi. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Kwo binali; aga marhegeko<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13, 9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-17">Lub 20, 13-17</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Orhahîra okahusha; orhahîra okaniga; orhahîra okazimba; orhahîra okayêmêra enyifinjo mbî,</char> n’agandi marhegeko, goshi gali muli eci cinwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ozigire owinyu…, lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19, 18</ref></char>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Ozigire abinyu nk’oku ocîzigira wêne.</char> <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Ahâli obuzigire harhankaboneka bubî oku bandi. Kuziga obuzigire lyo ishwinjiro ly’amarhegeko.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuce buli hôfi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Câba murhahabiri mango gahi gano rhulimwo. Amango g’okuzûka gahisire. Obucire bukola burhuli hôfi kulusha amango rhwarhondêraga okuyêmêra. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Obudufu bwaling’igera, n’obuce buyiruka. Kuziga rhulekage ebijiro by’o­mwizimya, rhufumbarhe amatumu g’obulangashane. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Rhucîkenge omu lugendo lwîrhu nk’oku kukwânîne okujira izûba lyabasha. Rhuleke obudambî n’e­ndalwè; ntà kuhusha na ntà kujira eby’obumaguza; ntà nnongwè na ntà bumvu; <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>mucihundikire Nyakasane Yezu Kristu, murhanacikâg’irhogoza omu­biri omu kushimba enyifinjo zâgwo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuzigira abazamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Oli ngonyi omu buyêmêre mumuyankirire buzira kumujisa kadali oku bimurhindiza. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Hali omanya mpu ankalya ngasi biryo; omuzamba yêhe arhalya ezirhali nshogo-lubala zône. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Owalya amanye arhagayaguzagya orhalya; n’orhalya arhagambaga owalya, bulya Nnâmahanga amuyankirîre. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Oli ndi w’oyo mpu watwa olwa mwambali wa bene? Ayîmanzire erhi ahirimire, okwo kuyêrekîre nnâhamwâbo. Ci kuyimanga anayôrha ayîmanzire, bulya arhali misî Nyakasane abuzire y’okumulanga arhahirime. <verse eid="ROM 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Hali omanya mpu olusiku lurhashusha lundi; haligi n’owundi omanya mpu ensiku zoshi ziri kuguma. Ngasi muguma ashimbe oku abwîne omu irhwe lyâge. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Okenga e­nsiku, akujira Nyakasane orhumire; n’olya ngasi biryo, Nyakasane orhuma akujira, bulya avuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa; orhalya naye Nyakasane orhuma akuleka, anavuga Nnâmahanga omunkwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Bulya ntâye muli rhwe ocîlamira yêne, na ntâye ocîfîra yêne. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Rhukalama, Nyakasane rhulamira, na rhukafà, Nyakasane rhufîra. Omu kalamo n’omu lufù, rhuli ba Nyakasane. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Bulya Kristu afîre anafûka mpu lyo abà Mwâmi w’abafîre n’abazîne. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Ci w’oyo, ci­rhuma otwa olubanja lwa mwene winyu? Nâwe we, cirhuma ogayaguza mwene winyu? Kali rhweshi rhweshi rhwâhamagalwe omu lukîko lwa Nyamuzinda, <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14, 11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Iz 45, 23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:18">49, 18</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Nyakasane adesire, erhi: Mbofa akalamo kâni orhabwîni ngasi idwi lyanfukamira na ngasi lulimi lwahà Nyamuzinda irenge lyâge!</char> <verse eid="ROM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Kuli kuderha oku ngasi muguma muli rhwe ânabûlane yêne embere za Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Kuziga rhuleke okukâtwîrana emmanja rhwêne na nnene; rhumanye erhi kwo rhwankarhuma mwene wîrhu asârhala erhi ahirima. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Mmanyire, nna­nyêmîre muli Nyakasane oku ntà kantu kahumânya omu bwôrhere bwâko; ci obwîne oku kantu kalebe kali kabî, oyo kanamuhumânya. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Erhi wankalêrhera mwene winyu oburhè erhi biryo birhuma, erhi orhacishimbiri enjira y’obuzigire. Mâshi omanye wankarhuma mwene winyu Kristu afîraga ahera erhi biryo byâwe birhuma! <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Mumanye mwankalangika irenge lìnyu oku bijâci. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Kali Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda burhali bwâmi bwa biryo erhi bwa binyôbwa, ci bubà bushinganyanya, na murhûla, na nshagali muli Mûka Mutagatîfu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Okolera Kristu ntyôla, asîmîsa Nnâmahanga, n’abantu banamusîme. <verse eid="ROM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Kuziga kukwânîne rhushimbûlire ebilêrha omurhûla n’ebyankarhabâla abirhu. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Mâshi omanye wa­nkanashâba omukolo gwa Nnâmahanga erhi biryo birhuma. Nêci, ntahabiri oku ebiryo byoshi biri binjà; ci bihinduka bibî oku muntu obirya omu kusârhaza abandi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Kuli kwinjà okurhâlya enyama, okurhanywa erivayi, n’okurhajira akantu kankarhuma mwene winyu asârhala, erhi ahirima, erhi abula emisî. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Obuyêmêre bwâwe ogwêrhe, obulange omu murhima gwâwe embere za Nnâmahanga. Iragi lyâge omuntu omurhima gwâge gurhalongoza amango adwîrhe ahiga ebi ajira! <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Ci ngasi yêshi ojakw’alya anadwîrhe arhindira, erhi mîra ayâgaga, bulya arhashimbiri izù ly’obuyêmêre bwâge; na ngasi kantu karharhenga omu izù ly’obuyêmêre erhi câha.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Rhw’ono, rhwe rhugwêrhe emisî, kukwânîne rhulembere obuzamba bw’engonyi, rhunaleke okukâlongereza ebirhusimîsize. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Ngasi muguma muli rhwe alonze okusîmîsa abâbo omu kujira aminjà n’omu kuhâna olwiganyo lwinjà. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Bulya Kristu naye arhalongerezagya ebimusimîsize yêne; ci nk’oku biyandisirwe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 69:10."><ref loc="PSA 69:68--1">Lul 69(68), 10</ref></char></note>: <char style="qt">Ebijâci by’abakujâcira nabirage nie bicîyôhakwo. </char> <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>N’ebyayandikagwa mîra byoshi, rhwe byayandikiragwa, mpu bibè nyigîrizo zîrhu, lyo rhubà n’obulangâlire omu kubona kurhi Nnâmahanga akâg’irhandûla n’oku­rhûliriza olubaga lwâge omu Mandiko matagatîfu. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Mâshi Nyamuzinda, cisiki c’okulembera amalibuko n’ec’oburhûlirize<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Sam 22, 50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:50">Lul 18, 50</ref>.</char></note>, ammuhè okuyumvanya mwêne na nnene oku lwîganyo lwa Yezu Kristu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>lyo mweshi haguma n’omurhima muguma n’izù liguma, muhà Nyamuzinda n’Îshe wa Nnawîrhu Yezu irenge. <verse eid="ROM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Co cirhumire mukâyankirirana mwêne na nnene nka kulya Kristu a­mmuyankiriraga oku irenge lya Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Ka mmubwîne bwinjà: Kristu acîjizire murhumisi w’abakembûle, mpu lyo ayunjuza amalaganyo Nyamuzinda alaganyagya bashakulûza bâbo. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Nabo abapagani bakuza Nyamuzinda erhi bwonjo bwâge burhuma, nka kulya Amandiko gadesire, mpu: <char style="qt">Okwo kwo kwanârhume nakukuza omu mashanja, nnanyimbe irenge ly’izîno lyâwe</char>. <verse eid="ROM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Kuyandisirwe kandi, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Lush 32, 43</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Mwe mashanja g’igulu, mucîshinge haguma n’olubaga lwâge.</char> <verse eid="ROM 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Kushubir’iyandikwa, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 117:1."><ref loc="PSA 117:116--1">Lul 117(116), 1</ref></char></note>: <char style="qt">Mwe mashanja mweshi, mukuze Nyakasane, ninyu lubaga lwoshi lw’igulu, mukome kagasha</char>. <verse eid="ROM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Naye Izaya adesire, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Iz 11, 10</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Mwene Yese âyisha, ayish’irhegeka amashanja goshi; ye wanabà bulangâlire bw’abantu b’igulu lyoshi. </char> <verse eid="ROM 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Nyamuzinda w’okulangalirwa ammuhè amasîma n’omurhûla omu buyêmêre bwinyu, lyo muyunjula bulangâlire oku buzibu bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">III. Enyûshûlo</para>
  <para style="s1">Obugo bwa Paolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Nâni niene mmanyire kwinjà, bene wîrhu, oku mw’oyo muyunjwîre nkengêro nyinjà, oku muyunjwîre ngasi bumanye, n’oku muhashire okukâhanûlana mwêne na nnene. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Ci kurharhumire ntammuyandikira, na haguma ntammufyefyerhîze, nti mmukengêze, nnanshimbe izù ly’enshôkano Nnâmahanga anshobôzize <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>y’okubà mujà-bugo wa Yezu Kristu omu bapagani na mudâhwa w’Emyanzi y’Akalembe ya Nnâmahanga, nti lyo enterekêro y’abapagani ehinduka ntagatîfu muli Mûka Mwimâna, enasîmîse Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Ntyôla nâni nancîkunga muli Yezu Kristu nkalola omukolo nkolera Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Bulya ntâko nakahalîzize okuderha ebi Yezu Kristu arhanjirisagya mpu lyo abapagani bayumva, omu nderho n’omu bijiro, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>oku buhashe bw’ebimanyîso n’ebisômerîne, n’oku buhashe bwa Mûka gwa Nyamuzinda. Ntyôla kwo nalumîzize Emyanzi y’Akalembe ya Kristu kurhenga e Yeruzalemu kuhika e Iliriya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iliriya càli cihugo luhù-nyanja Adriyatika, ye Sloveniya ene</char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Ci kwône nalonza okumanyîsa Emyanzi y’Akalembe aha izîno lya Kristu lirhal’isâg’imanyibwa, nti ntag’iyûbakira oku ciriba cahumbagwa n’owundi, <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>nti lyo nnanshimba kulya kuyandisirwe, mpu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15, 21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Iz 52, 15</ref>.</char></note>: <char style="qt">Balya barhasâg’imubwirwa, bâmubone, na balya barhasâg’iyumva bamuderha, bâmuyumve</char>.<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emihigo y’okubalama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Okwôla kwo kwakazâg’impanza kanji-kanji okujà emwinyu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Ci lêro bunôla ntà mukolo ncigwêrhe mwo bino bihugo, na kulya kubà kurhenga myâka minji erhi kucîfinja ncîfinja okujà emwinyu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>hano njà e Hispaniya… Lêro nnangâlîre nti nammubona hano ngera, na nti mwe mwanayish’impisa omu njira y’okujayo bano mbà namâyûs’immukumbuluka. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Ci bunôla nkola narhang’ijà e Yeruzalemu, ngend’irhumikirayo abatagatîfu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Bulya Macedoniya n’Akaya bàhizire okusholôlera abatagatîfu b’e Yeruzalemu bali omu bulagîrire. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Nêci, bahizire okujira ntyo, ci erhi banakurhegesirwe; bulyâla, akabà abapagani bashangîre oku minjà g’obunya-mûka, nabo bakwânîne babarhabâle n’aminjà g’en’igulu. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Hano mbà namâyûsa ogwo mulimo, na hano mbà namâbafumbika eyo nsholôlo, lyo najà e Hispaniya, ngerere emwinyu. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Nnamanyire oku obu najà emwinyu, nayisha ndwîrhe obwimâna bw’obwangà bwa Kristu. <verse eid="ROM 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Mmuhûnyire, mâshi bene wîrhu, Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu orhumire n’obuzigire bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu, nti mundwîre omu kunsengerera emwa Nnâmahanga, <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>lyo nfuma ababula-buyêmêre b’e Yudeya, lyo n’entûlo nahêka e Yeruzalemu eyankirirwa kwinjà n’abatagatîfu. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Na ntyo nyishe emwinyu n’e­nshagali, na Nyamuzinda akalonza, nduhûkire hitya ekâgarhî kinyu. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Nyamuzinda w’omurhûla abè ninyu mweshi! Nêci, Ntyo!<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Amahano mazinda n’omusingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Mmuhûnyire muyankirire kwinjà mwâli wîrhu Febe, murhumisi-kazi w’Ekleziya y’e Cenkri. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Mumuyankirire muli Nyakasane nk’oku binakwânîne abatagatîfu, munamurhabâle oku ngasi kantu ankalagîrirakwo, bulya naye arhabîre bene wîrhu banji, na ciru nâni niene. <verse eid="ROM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Mundamukize Priska n’Akwila, bo rhukola rhweshi muli Kristu Yezu; <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>ciru balinzig’itûbwa irhwe mpu lyo banciza; arhali nienene nkwânîne okubavuga omunkwa, ci n’Ekleziya z’abarhengaga omu bapagani zoshi. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Mundamukize n’endêko y’abemêzi babugânana aha mwâbo. Mundamukize omwîra wâni Epeneto, ye ntûlo ntanzi Aziya yarhûlaga Kristu. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Mulamuse Mariya wammurhamîre kulya. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Mulamuse Androniko na Yuniya; bali ba bûko bwîrhu, rhwanali omu mpamikwa rhweshi nabo; ziri ntumwa za kukengwa zanshokoleraga okubà baganda ba Kristu. <verse eid="ROM 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Mundamukize Ampliyato; abà muzigirwa wâni bwenêne muli Nyakasane. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Mundamukize owîrhu Urbano rhukola rhweshi muli Kristu, n’omwîra wâni Staki. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Mulamuse Apeli; ayêrekîne oku anabà okuli muganda wa Kristu. Mulamuse ab’aha mw’Aristobulo boshi. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Mundamukize Herodiyoni; abà wa bûko bwâni. Mulamuse ngasi boshi b’aha mwa Narsisi bali ba Nyakasane. <verse eid="ROM 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Mulamuse Trifesa na Trifoza bakârhamira Nyakasane. Mulamuse Persida muzigirwa wâni; arhamîre bwenêne omu kukolera Nyakasane. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Mundamukize Rufo, ntôle ya Nyakasane; mundamukize n’omuzîre wâge na nyâmà. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Mulamuse Asinkrito, na Flegoni, na Hermesi, na Patroba, na Herma, na bene wîrhu bali boshi. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Mulamuse Filologo na Yuliya, Nereyo na mwâli wâbo, na Olimpiya, n’abatagatîfu boshi babà nabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Mulamusanye n’ehinunugurho hitagatîfu. Ekleziya za Kristu zoshi zimmulamusize. <verse eid="ROM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Mmuhûnyire, bene wîrhu, nti mucîlange kwa bala bakâlonza okummushâbira n’okummusârhaza, n’obwo arhali ntyo kwo mwayigîrizibwe; abo mu­bayâke. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Bulya abantu ba bene abo barhakolera Nnawîrhu Kristu; ci enda zâbo; kandi n’enderho zâbo nnunu-nnunu n’ez’obulimirizi, banarhebe emirhima y’abarhabâmwo bulyâlya. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Nêci, omwanzi gw’obumvi bwinyu gwalumîre hoshi; munsimîsize nâni; ci kwônene nalonza mubè benge omu minjà na bahwinja omu bubî. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Nyamuzinda w’omurhûla arhayimang’ivungunyula Shetani aha magulu ginyu. Enshôkano ya Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu ebè ninyu! <verse eid="ROM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Owîrhu Timoteyo rhukola rhweshi ammulamusize bo na Luciyo, na Yasoni, na Sosipatro, b’omu bûko bwâni. <verse eid="ROM 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Nâni mmulamusize muli Nyakasane, nie Tersiyo nayandikaga agâla maruba. <verse eid="ROM 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Gâyo ompandîsa, nie n’Ekleziya yoshi, mpu asingi. Erasto, ye mubîsi w’ebirugu by’ecishagala, bona mwene wîrhu Kwarto, mpu mmulamuse. [<verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Enshôkano ya Nnawîrhu Yezu Kristu ebè ninyu mweshi! Amen!] Irenge kuli Nyamuzinda emyâka n’emyâka! [<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Ayâgirwe Olya ogwêrhe obuhashe bw’okummuzibuhya omu Myanzi y’Akalembe nyigîriza n’omu bugo bwa Yezu Kristu, nk’oku bifulwîrwe mwa lirya ihwe lyàli lifulike amagana g’emyâka. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Ci lêro buno likola limanyîkîne, n’oku bulonza bwa Nnâmahanga oyôrha abâho emyâka n’emyâka, oku burhabâle bw’amandiko g’abalêbi, lyahisire omu mashanja goshi mpu balimanye, lyo bashimba enjira y’obuyêmêre. <verse eid="ROM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Kuli oyo Nyamuzinda, ôbà yêne Mushinganyanya, irenge emyâka n’emyâka, Yezu Kristu orhumire! Amen!]<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
